@@ -0,0 +1,16 @@
+# Urbanist
+
+Original, unmodified variable font from Google Fonts:
+https://github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/urbanist
+
+Downloaded on 2026-11-04 from:
+https://raw.githubusercontent.com/google/fonts/main/ofl/urbanist/Urbanist%5Bwght%5D.ttf
+
+Copyright 2021 The Urbanist Project Authors (https://github.com/coreyhu/Urbanist).
+License: SIL Open Font License 1.1, included in `Urbanist-OFL.txt`.
+The HTML license link includes that license in the Vite production output.
+
+SHA256: `748362d51eb276840e9f0023cd2d98299bf709a95fb3a5ae4ffcb624c638ebb9`
+
+The file supports weights 100 through 900. R1 shared components use 400,
+500, 600 and 700; the full axis also supports existing page weights.
